You'll find many project in this repository, a chatbot loading in the terminal,
a voice assistant, a downloader, a downloader (with many platform access), an AI using
Google API with a frontend in js/css/html and a backend in python. You'll even see some
project related with datacamp.

This file will contain all the things that you'll need to upload my project:
   - pip install Customtkinter --> for graphical part
   - pip install pygame --> for graphical part
   - pip install YoutubeSearch --> api for youtube search (optional)
   - pip install SpeachRecognition --> basic api for speach to text
   - pip install pyttsx3 --> basic api for text to speach
   - pip install PyPDF2 --> for pdf treatment
   - pip install PyPDF --> for pdf treatment
   - pip install fpdf --> for pdf treatment
   - pip install reportlab --> for pdf treatment
   - pip install panda --> for exel file treatment
   - pip install reportlab pandas openpyxl python-docx python-pptx


For the js part
   - npm install express
   - npm install bcrypt
   - npm install mysql2
   - npm install cors

   use node to lauch the node js who will help you with the login/signup part

Languages presents in this repository

